  "question": "On four deterministic larger actual CM8 twist fixtures, compare full cold generic recovery controls and SAME-input polynomial certificate/root kernels against NTL, with independent scalars/event traces and retained per-input timing distributions. Kernel and generic recovery are separate scopes, not complete IC cost.",
